I was playing a Valkerie yesterday.  Game was going ok, and found assorted
weapons/armor on second level.  When I put on some padded gloves, I noted
a small chance in the status line, I though this might be my AC.  But when I 
looked I suddenly had a strength of 25!!!  They were gauntlets (gloves?) of 
power!!! WOW this is going Great!

Hacked my was (easily) to 6th level, which happened to be a Bones level for
2 characters.  Fortunetly for my, most of the cursed stuff was still ok to
use (ie potion of blindness since I was telepathic).  Went back up to the 
shops on previous level and bought them out as well.  As an attemp to
uncurse/bless some of the bones objects, I dipped a sword into a fountain,
which proceed to overflow and create a deep puddle blocking one exit into the
room.  No prob, since I could still reach the down stairs from here. 

Continued past 6th to 8th level, and came across an unknown scroll, and when i 
read it, found myself on 2nd again.  No problem, just keep heading down.

Got to the level which had the fountain on it, and analyized the sit.  The room
with the fountain and the down stairs was filled with killer bees.  They had 
almost wiped my out earlier, and I didnt want to try to fight em again.  So,
grabbing a potion of levitation (didnt know if it was cursed or not), i 
calculated the spot where i should drink it to get me over the puddle, and then 
drop me right on top of the down stairs, without fighting any bees. Quaffed the 
potion, and made way for the exit.  However, when i cross the puddle, the 
levitation ran out, and gulg, gulg, gulg....my valkerie had been drown.

AARRRRRRGGGGGGGG!!!!!!!!

BTW this is a great way of getting blank paper for scrolls   :)


